Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:50:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] FileChooser: keep only Quick Look, drop the side panel

With Quick Look on the space bar the preview panel is not needed, so the
file list gets its width back. Files are now only loaded while Quick
Look is open. The module is renamed to quick_look.rs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013Fj1pH1E6FTTQuV8fXeAkd
